        "id": 5642
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-05-13T14:13:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hmm, I think so yeah: technically, if the dest path is simply being reassigned (`*dst \u003d tmpPath`), that should be fine; but as a general direction we do want to avoid out params in SkPath.\n\nReturning a new value is a cleaner API, the only tricky bit is the `dst \u003d\u003d this` optimization - but call sites that care about that case should be using a builder.",
      "parentUuid": "5b9b5db2_f87b349b",
